# The Kid: never a joke, never a threat. Two conversations: the name, and an ask while lost. A
# promise to get them home (walk.) is kept by the world: when the Kid is settled at a house.

conv wanderer.kid.name
for wanderer:kid
topic "What's your name?"
prio flavour
voice plain

node start
  say "My mum said not to tell people my name. Then she said if I'm ever lost, tell a grown-up. I don't know which one you are yet."
  > @mine "I'll tell you mine first, if you like." -> name
  > @ok "That's fine. You can keep it." -> keep

node name
  say "Okay. That's fair. You can call me what my class called me on the trip. It's not very nice, so I won't say it. We were on a school trip when the roads shut."
  say "Miss said stay together and hold hands at the roads. I'm hungry, but I'm not supposed to say that either."
  > @back1 "Let me ask you something else." -> hub

node keep
  say "Thank you. Most grown-ups keep asking until you tell them. You didn't. I'll tell you later, maybe, if you're still here."
  > @back2 "Deal. Can I ask you something else?" -> hub

conv wanderer.kid.home
for wanderer:kid
when kidlost
topic "Where's home? Where are you going?"
prio ask
voice plain

node start
  say "There was a gym. With a bear on the door. Miss said they'd come back for the ones outside, after they'd counted everyone inside."
  say "I waited by the bins until it got dark, and nobody came, so I walked. I don't walk at night now. I don't know the way back to the bear."
  > @show "I'll show you the way to a house." -> walk
  > @promise "I'll get you home. I promise." -> walk   do promise:walk.home:3h
  > @later "Stay here. Someone will come." -> wait

node walk
  say "Is it far? I can walk far. I just can't walk at night. If I hold your sleeve, will you go slow at the corners?"
  do call:slot:0
  > @back3 "I'll go slow. Can I ask you something?" -> hub

node wait
  say "Everyone says that. Then nobody comes, and it gets dark again."
  > @show2 "All right. I'll take you there myself." -> walk
  > @back4 "Let me ask you something else." -> hub
